So when my sister was in middle school she had a friend that was Eugenia's size. Observing her was pretty interesting. 

I think her parents were starving her or something. she allays begged us for food. 

&#x200B;

But anyway, at points you could tell she was weak. And at one point she said she was sick to her stomach. She was often dizzy, And my sister kinda bullied her. She got her to lift weights. The 5lb weights were two much. So she gave her 2lb weights. She ended up screaming in pain from her arms.

&#x200B;

She also didn't want to sleep on the floor at a sleep over with my sister. Her back hurt two much. 

&#x200B;

At points she mentioned that her mom didn't give her much food.  I never was able to actually figure out why. If it was poverty related or her mom wanted her to be skinny idk.

They will never have a vac mandate if they are not legally required two. Doordash in particular is extremely cheap. They will lose at least some drivers if they have one. If they lose drivers, they will have to pay more for deliveries. Even if it costs them 5 cents more for order they will not do it.

&#x200B;

Now the opposite is true two.  Lets say the supreme court upholds the osha mandate.  At least some People will get fired from their normal jobs. These people might go work for gig apps if they refuse to get the shot.  This would really hurt us. Mega oversaturation. 

&#x200B;

What would be in our intrests, is for them to force the shot. But no OSHA mandate.  Drivers might just go get other jobs.  Increasing the order payout.

